{"ref":"BDB, מַחְלִי","hw":"מַחְלִי","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְלִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  Levite, son of Merari <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:19\" href=\"/Exodus.6.19\">Ex 6:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:20\" href=\"/Numbers.3.20\">Nu 3:20</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.4\">1 Ch 6:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.21\">23:21</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.26\">24:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.28\">28</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:18\" href=\"/Ezra.8.18\">Ezr 8:18</a> (prob.), 𝔊 Μοολλει.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Mushi, and grandson of Merari <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.32\">1 Ch 6:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.23\">23:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.30\">24:30</a>, 𝔊 Μοολει, Μοολ(λ)ι.","next":"BDB, מַחְלִי²","prev":"BDB, מַחְלוֹן"}